+    // patch 0082: rep_exec_vm only wraps the innermost VM call inside
+    // DoRunScriptFuncCantBlock() -- GameUpdateEarlyRepExec()/
+    // GameUpdateLateRepExec() THEMSELVES (the actual call sites in
+    // UpdateGameOnce()) were never bracketed as wholes, leaving
+    // run_function_on_non_blocking_thread()'s own wrapper overhead
